In a Hub-and-Spoke model:
1. Pillar Page (Hub): Comprehensive, high-level guide covering the core topic (e.g. 'Complete Guide to Enterprise Intent OS');
2. Cluster Pages (Spokes): In-depth articles addressing specific long-tail queries (e.g. 'EDL Architecture', 'Human Approval Gates');
3. Internal Linking: All spokes link back to the pillar using exact semantic anchor text, passing topical authority to the hub.
